  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Gary Markel is an American insurance businessman and grandson of the founder of Markel Corporation. He held shares in the family insurer and led his own insurance agencies in Florida. Now retired in Naples, he co-founded Operation Healing Forces with his wife Denise to support Special Operations service members and their families.",
    "confidence": {
